VALUES ('Monday.com AI', 'monday.com', 'compliant', '"monday.com does not use Customer Data and/or Content to train artificial intelligence models and does not allow others to do so." "Such data will not be shared with third parties and may be retained by us for up to 60 days." "To clarify, regardless of whether your Admin(s) opts-out, such data will not be used to train models." The admin opt-out covers using interaction data to improve monday.com''s Services, not training (which the AI Terms say never happens). Source: monday AI Terms, last updated 5 May 2026.', NULL, 0, NULL, '["https://monday.com/l/legal/ai/"]', 1, 0, 0, '2026-11-09T09:09:24.000Z', 0, 1, 0);
