VALUES ('Intercom Fin', 'intercom.com', 'compliant_with_caveats', '"The Fin CX Models are trained using de-identified customer data (as described below) from production Fin conversation logs." "Conversations between our customers'' human agents and their end-users are not used for training." "If you want to opt out of AI model training and fine-tuning, you can request an opt-out through Settings > Workspace > Security > AI model training and fine-tuning." "We will process all customer opt-out requests within 30 days of the submission of your request." Training on Fin conversation content is on by default for standard workspaces (with listed exclusions such as signed BAA, EU/AU regionally hosted workspaces, earlier opt-outs, negotiated contracts signed before September 2025, and trial accounts). The opt-out is workspace-level. Source: Intercom help article dated 8 September 2026.', NULL, 1, NULL, '["https://www.intercom.com/help/en/articles/11993352-ai-model-training-and-fine-tuning"]', 1, 0, 0, '2026-11-09T09:09:24.000Z', 1, 1, 0);
